From: SparkRing GB10 semantic port
Subject: [PATCH] Harden DeepSeek V4 sparse rows and malformed DSML recovery

Ports local-inference-lab/vllm PR 431 Python/Triton row clamps and
vllm-project/vllm PR 52645 at 3df9776b0d423dd3124ee9ae80d9d92aef92013a
onto Fujitsu GB10 vLLM source e2666d9a65f41fc376607531453cbd57c4c71016.
The streaming-parser port retains the GB10 drop-token and skip-tool control
flow while adding provisional orphan-invoke recovery.

